# Retrieval defaults only: keep historical evidence out of broad ripgrep searches.
# This does not untrack files, alter validators, or restrict direct file access.
# For an assigned run/release or historical investigation, use --no-ignore on
# its explicit path, not on the whole repository. See the context policy.
/pipeline/runs/*
!/pipeline/runs/README.md
/pipeline/releases/*
!/pipeline/releases/README.md
